# Project instructions (Claude Code)

This project uses rtl-harness, checked out as the `{{harness_dir}}/` submodule. The rules,
workflow and tools are defined there and imported below; do not restate them here.

@{{harness_dir}}/AGENTS.md

## This project

- Design files: see `harness.toml` `[design].sources`; tests: `[sim].tests`.
- Tools: the `rtl-harness` MCP server registered in `.mcp.json` exposes run_lint, run_sim,
  get_waveform and list_design. All paths are relative to this project root.
- Tickets: `uv run --project {{harness_dir}} rtl-harness ticket new --kind <bug|deviation|rule|tool> --domain <bus|cpu|verif> --title "..."`.

